{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108322","id":2643985205,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6dmAM1","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108322","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108322.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108322.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108322","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108322/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108322/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108322/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/3ec5fe90cd7d17d724eb1a44dda50640690ab2e8","number":108322,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Change `PROPERTY_HINT_GROUP_ENABLE` behavior to read_only","user":{"login":"lodetrick","id":146759331,"node_id":"U_kgDOCL9eow","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146759331?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick","html_url":"https://github.com/lodetrick","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This PR follows from the discussion on #108257.\r\n\r\nCurrently, when Inspector Sections are toggled off, they hide all their children in order to convey that these children have no impact on the current state of the object. However, there is another way to convey this, which is by making all the children `read_only`. This has the benefit of not hiding child properties, while also showing that it makes no sense to edit them.\r\n\r\nThis PR is meant to be a test of the `read_only` approach, and if it has support, to replace the current method.\r\n\r\nTODO:\r\n- [ ] Have the read_only change affect more classes\r\n- [ ] Find a way to deal with external changes to the properties (ideally avoiding an `update_tree()` call each time it is ticked)\n\nEdit: I looked into it more and believe that calling `update_tree` every time something checks that mark is the only \"proper\" way to do it at the moment, without more sophisticated methods of dealing with read_only","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097162,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTcxNjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/discussion","name":"discussion","description":"","color":"ccaaff","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undeterm